        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154410/extras/9d06e9ab04e74e30e96ec87ad26d4539.poster.avif?t=1770303952\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154410/extras/9d06e9ab04e74e30e96ec87ad26d4539.webm?t=1770303952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154410/extras/9d06e9ab04e74e30e96ec87ad26d4539.mp4?t=1770303952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CAN YOU BECOME THE BEST?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RoboLeague</strong> is a<i> fast-paced</i> multiplayer input-driven football game where you have a chance to showcase your greatness by mastering unique combination of <i>technical skill</i> and <i>teamwork coordination</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game <i>stands</i> out because it provides a <strong>smooth</strong>, <strong>fast</strong>, <strong>physics-driven</strong> multiplayer experience that is highly competitive and rewards skill that is second-to-none in this genre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now dominate the field by perfecting your shooting, curve shot, dribbling, passing, and defending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique position-based abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom lobby creation system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&amp; Many more!</p></li></ul>",
